{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Collection Item","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404024","type":"Type"}],"id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/touring-exhibition/876","identified_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"preferred term","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404670"}],"content":"Radical Abstraction","type":"Name"}],"produced_by":{"carried_out_by":[{"_label":"Georgia O'Keeffe Museum","id":"actor/1","type":"Actor"}],"timespan":{"type":"TimeSpan"},"type":"Production"},"referred_to_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"description statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"}],"content":"From 1915 onwards, O’Keeffe’s engagement with abstraction remained one of the defining features of her modern practice. This exhibition will bring together a selection of works from the Museum’s permanent collection that exemplify O’Keeffe’s sometimes radical approach to abstraction. Altogether these will present an “alternative” chronology to the one set out in our thematic galleries, highlighting a central preoccupation of O’Keeffe’s over the course of a long and productive career.","type":"LinguisticObject"}],"representation":[],"type":"Activity"}